le glycerin.\n- **Third-party listings** name the same four herbs, but they describe them differently. One Australian retailer says the blend features Cleavers, Red Clover, Red Root, and Prickly Ash Bark, and a New Zealand retailer lists Cleavers Aerial Parts, Red Clover Blossom Extract, Red Root, Prickly Ash Bark.\n- **Label details** from a pharmacy database list stillingia root extract, which is Queen's Delight in that database's group naming. It also gives the proprietary blend as 300 mg per serving, with Glycerin Water as other ingredients.\n\nThe sources don't say whether \"red root\" is a separate herb or another name for stillingia. Check the product label for the exact botanical names.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3373edb3-ea35-4c09-93cb-41b8e7cea5f5","uuid":"7ea1bb1c-8ff1-4454-b9d1-4edeaf19e245","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:11:22.730Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage liquid herbal extract ingredients red root ocotillo","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012tJY2F3MW8y2dPxYd41h9j","content":[{"title":"NEW CUSTOMERS: ENJOY 20% OFF WITH CODE NEW20","url":"https://www.naturessunshine.com/product/lymphatic-drainage"},{"title":"NEW CUSTOMERS: ENJOY 20% OFF WITH CODE NEW20","url":"https://shop.naturessunshine.com/product/lymphatic-drainage"},{"title":"SuppCo Splash","url":"https://supp.co/products/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-099904031715-8aae0662-1677531736"},{"title":"Lymphatic Drainage By Nature's Sunshine Overview & Drug Interactions","url":"https://hellopharmacist.com/drug-supplement-interactions/supplements/lymphatic-drainage-by-nature-s-sunshine-105932"},{"title":"Picture 1 of 12","url":"https://www.ebay.com/itm/397602003111"},{"title":"NEW CUSTOMERS: ENJOY 20% OFF WITH CODE NEW20","url":"https://www.naturessunshine.com/product/lymphatic-drainage?offer=nsp"},{"title":"Lymphatic Drainage By Nature's S