{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dr3agAmHzrf11s27koYTk2","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage reviews\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"explore customer insights on lymphatic drainage supplement amazon en us 157010\",\"url\":\"https://kimola.com/reports/explore-customer-insights-on-lymphatic-drainage-supplement-amazon-en-us-157010\"},{\"title\":\"CURRENTLY SOLD OUT\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.com.au/p/1501076758\"},{\"title\":\"natures sunshine lymphatic drainage review\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibisik.com/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-review/\"},{\"title\":\"Lymphoria Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=10\"},{\"title\":\"natures sunshine lymphatic drainage 2 fl oz lymphatic\",\"url\":\"https://www.nullfake.com/amazon/us/B000WQFIJA/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-2-fl-oz-lymphatic\"},{\"title\":\"www.ibisik.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibisik.com/?p=21115\"},{\"title\":\"Nature’s Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage Review: Does It Work?\",\"url\":\"https://eatproteins.com/nature-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-review/\"},{\"title\":\"NEW CUSTOMERS: ENJOY 20% OFF WITH CODE NEW20\",\"url\":\"https://www.naturessunshine.com/product/lymphatic-drainage\"},{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/reviews/product/17144619230\"},{\"title\":\"Lymphoria Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=7\"},{\"title\":\"Picture 1 of 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.com/itm/397602003111\"},{\"title\":\"www.retailcoupons.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.retailcoupons.com/?p=22092\"},{\"title\":\"SuppCo Splash\",\"url\":\"https://supp.co/products/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-099904031715-8aae0662-1677531736\"},{\"title\":\"FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $74.99 *excludes Rural Delivery\",\"url\":\"https://unichemgreenhithe.co.nz/products/natures-sun-lymphatic-drainage-59ml\"},{\"title\":\"Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage\",\"url\":\"https://www.netpharmacy.co.nz/a/s/products/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage\"},{\"title\":\"Show ratings & reviews for\",\"url\":\"https://reviews.webmd.com/vitamins-supplements/ingredientreview-159-clivers\"},{\"title\":\"best lymphatic drainage drops 2026 lymph tonic review explores daily wellness\",\"url\":\"https://www.newswire.com/news/best-lymphatic-drainage-drops-2026-lymph-tonic-review-explores-daily-wellness\"}]\n\nThe search turned up mostly third-party commentary rather than direct customer reviews, and the sources vary in reliability.\n\n- **Mixed sentiment:** One report on Amazon feedback describes reviews as mixed, with some users praising its effectiveness in promoting lymphatic health and alleviating swelling, particularly after a week of use.\n- **Review volume and authenticity:** A site called Nullfake, which analyzes reviews for fakes, reports 5,807 total reviews on Amazon and judges the product legitimate despite a small percentage of potentially fake ones. Its conclusion that the product is effective rests on the volume and personal tone of reviews, not on clinical evidence.\n- **Independent reviews:** Reviewers on eatproteins.com and ibisik.com are measured. One says results vary widely between individual users and that there is no clinical trial on this exact formula. The other says a supplement can complement a healthy lifestyle, but it is unlikely to be a miracle solution.\n- **Side effects:** Eatproteins.com lists mild stomach upset on an empty stomach, a temporary change in urine color, and rare allergic reactions to ragweed-family herbs.\n- **Retailer ratings:** A Walmart listing for a similar lymphatic drainage drops product shows 4.4 out of 5 stars from 304 ratings and 48 written reviews, though that listing may not be this exact Nature's Sunshine product.\n\nOverall, the reviews I found are mixed to positive, with many users reporting reduced puffiness or bloating and others seeing little effect. The Amazon-based analyses are the most data-heavy but come from aggregator sites, so I'd treat them cautiously. Reliable proof of effectiveness is lacking.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3373edb3-ea35-4c09-93cb-41b8e7cea5f5","uuid":"7894cfc2-2a2e-41a2-8b1d-6843f90883d8","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:11:23.302Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage reviews","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CgC5ZjHuo3nwVU7W66UvTe","content":[{"title":"explore customer insights on lymphatic drainage supplement amazon en us 157010","url":"https://kimola.com/reports/explore-customer-insights-on-lymphatic-drainage-supplement-amazon-en-us-157010"},{"title":"CURRENTLY SOLD OUT","url":"https://www.ebay.com.au/p/1501076758"},{"title":"natures sunshine lymphatic drainage review","url":"https://www.ibisik.com/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-review/"},{"title":"Lymphoria Reviews","url":"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=10"},{"title":"natures sunshine lymphatic drainage 2 fl oz lymphatic","url":"https://www.nullfake.com/amazon/us/B000WQFIJA/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-2-fl-oz-lymphatic"},{"title":"www.ibisik.com","url":"https://www.ibisik.com/?p=21115"},{"title":"Nature’s Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage Review: Does It Work?","url":"https://eatproteins.com/nature-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-review/"},{"title":"NEW CUSTOMERS: ENJOY 20% OFF WITH CODE NEW20","url":"https://www.naturessunshine.com/product/lymphatic-drainage"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/reviews/product/17144619230"},{"title":"Lymphoria Reviews","url":"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=7"},{"title":"Picture 1 of 12","url":"https://www.ebay.com/itm/397602003111"},{"title":"www.retailcoupons.com","url":"https://www.retailcoupons.com/?p=22092"},{"title":"SuppCo Splash","url":"https://supp.co/products/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage-099904031715-8aae0662-1677531736"},{"title":"FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $74.99 *excludes Rural Delivery","url":"https://unichemgreenhithe.co.nz/products/natures-sun-lymphatic-drainage-59ml"},{"title":"Nature's Sunshine Lymphatic Drainage","url":"https://www.netpharmacy.co.nz/a/s/products/natures-sunshine-lymphatic-drainage"},{"title":"Show ratings & reviews for","url":"https://reviews.webmd.com/vitamins-supplements/ingredientreview-159-clivers"},{"title":"best lymphatic drainage drops 2026 lymph tonic review explores daily wellness","url":"https://www.newswire.com/news/best-lymphatic-drainage-drops-2026-lymph-tonic-review-explores-daily-wellness"}]},"The search turned up mostly third-party commentary rather than direct customer reviews, and the sources vary in reliability.\n\n- **Mixed sentiment:** One report on Amazon feedback describes reviews as mixed, with some users praising its effectiveness in promoting lymphatic health and alleviating swelling, particularly after a week of use.\n- **Review volume and authenticity:** A site called Nullfake, which analyzes reviews for fakes, reports 5,807 total reviews on Amazon and judges the product legitimate despite a small percentage of potentially fake ones. Its conclusion that the product is effective rests on the volume and personal tone of reviews, not on clinical evidence.\n- **Independent reviews:** Reviewers on eatproteins.com and ibisik.com are measured. One says results vary widely between individual users and that there is no clinical trial on this exact formula. The other says a supplement can complement a healthy lifestyle, but it is unlikely to be a miracle solution.\n- **Side effects:** Eatproteins.com lists mild stomach upset on an empty stomach, a temporary change in urine color, and rare allergic reactions to ragweed-family herbs.\n- **Retailer ratings:** A Walmart listing for a similar lymphatic drainage drops product shows 4.4 out of 5 stars from 304 ratings and 48 written reviews, though that listing may not be this exact Nature's Sunshine product.\n\nOverall, the reviews I found are mixed to positive, with many users reporting reduced puffiness or bloating and others seeing little effect. The Amazon-based analyses are the most data-heavy but come from aggregator sites, so I'd treat them cautiously. Reliable proof of effectiveness is lacking."],"durationSeconds":6.340564624999999,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Dr3agAmHzrf11s27koYTk2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015JTEFRGXZgFkFM2jmYcSbx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:reddit.com lymphatic drainage drops supplement swelling worked\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"sites.google.com\",\"url\":\"https://sites.google.com/view/lymphflow/\"},{\"title\":\"Do Lymphatic Drainage Supplements Work?\",\"url\":\"https://superpower.com/supplement-guides/lymphatic-drainage-supplements\"},{\"title\":\"Doctors Note Logo\",\"url\":\"https://ubiehealth.com/doctors-note/does-lymphatic-drainage-drops-37-really-work-facts102q1\"},{\"title\":\"www.walmart.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/reviews/product/17144619230\"},{\"title\":\"Do Lymphatic Drainage Supplements Work?\",\"url\":\"https://superpower.com/guides/lymphatic-drainage-supplements\"},{\"title\":\"Lymphoria Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=10\"},{\"title\":\"# TLDR Review: MaryRuth's Lymphatic Support Drops\",\"url\":\"https://shopsavvy.com/reviews-tldr/maryruths-lymphatic-support-drops.md\"},{\"title\":\"shop.app\",\"url\":\"https://shop.app/products/8184327340077/lympha\"},{\"title\":\"Lymphoria Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://nz.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=5\"},{\"title\":\"~!@##$%^ vLymph Tonic Review 2026: Does Lymphatic Support Supplement Really Work? ###&^&\",\"url\":\"https://sites.google.com/view/vlymphtonicreview2026doeslymph\"},{\"title\":\"Does Lymph Tonic Really Help with Swelling & Circulation?\",\"url\":\"https://feedback.qbo.intuit.com/forums/920245-quickbooks-mobile-feedback-forum/suggestions/51142300-does-lymph-tonic-really-help-with-swelling-circu\"},{\"title\":\"Doctors Note Logo\",\"url\":\"https://ubiehealth.com/doctors-note/native-blooms-lymphatic-drainage-drops-benefits-27102q1\"},{\"title\":\"5529011 lymphatic drainage drops do they work\",\"url\":\"https://www.mumsnet.com/talk/_chat/5529011-lymphatic-drainage-drops-do-they-work\"},{\"title\":\"Supplement ReviewsSupplement Tips & Questions\",\"url\":\"https://www.samedaysupplements.com/blog/?p=20220\"},{\"title\":\"DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/rodrigo_saran_765b226c743/tired-of-swelling-unlock-natural-lymphatic-drainage-3fgm\"},{\"title\":\"Do Lymphatic Drainage Supplements Work?\",\"url\":\"https://wf.superpower.com/supplement-guides/lymphatic-drainage-supplements\"},{\"title\":\"Supplement ReviewsSupplement Tips & Questions\",\"url\":\"https://www.samedaysupplements.com/blog/supplement-reviews/lymphatic-supplements/\"},{\"title\":\"www.desertcart.com.cy\",\"url\":\"https://www.desertcart.com.cy/products/416878993\"}]\n\nThe search returned no Reddit threads. Every result came from vendor pages, health blogs, review sites, Mumsnet, or a QuickBooks forum post, so I can't report what Reddit users experienced.\n\nThe non-Reddit results mostly point to weak evidence. One review says lymphatic drainage drops are not proven to move lymph fluid, and no strong clinical evidence supports their marketing claims. Another notes that there isn't a large body of high quality randomized trials showing that any oral supplement directly and measurably increases lymphatic flow in otherwise healthy people. A third says the evidence for lymphatic drainage supplements is mixed and often conflates different types of swelling.\n\nSome results were more positive. One product-linked guide cites a small trial of a combination formula where participants reported reduced swelling and improved symptoms. A supplement-company blog describes a six-month trial of a different combination in people with mild to moderate lymphedema, but that is a marketing source, not a Reddit anecdote. Product review pages also exist, such as a Walmart listing with 304 ratings, but they don't show whether swelling improved.\n\nIf you want Reddit-specific anecdotes, try a search that names a specific product, such as \"Lymph Tonic\" or \"MaryRuth's lymphatic drops,\" together with \"reddit\" and \"swelling,\" or search the subreddits where these topics come up.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3373edb3-ea35-4c09-93cb-41b8e7cea5f5","uuid":"b5ad87ed-da18-43c3-bc65-def9a94f81ce","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:11:23.662Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"site:reddit.com lymphatic drainage drops supplement swelling worked","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01J3iLnT9W6csmrWy5BCMTUZ","content":[{"title":"sites.google.com","url":"https://sites.google.com/view/lymphflow/"},{"title":"Do Lymphatic Drainage Supplements Work?","url":"https://superpower.com/supplement-guides/lymphatic-drainage-supplements"},{"title":"Doctors Note Logo","url":"https://ubiehealth.com/doctors-note/does-lymphatic-drainage-drops-37-really-work-facts102q1"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/reviews/product/17144619230"},{"title":"Do Lymphatic Drainage Supplements Work?","url":"https://superpower.com/guides/lymphatic-drainage-supplements"},{"title":"Lymphoria Reviews","url":"https://ie.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=10"},{"title":"# TLDR Review: MaryRuth's Lymphatic Support Drops","url":"https://shopsavvy.com/reviews-tldr/maryruths-lymphatic-support-drops.md"},{"title":"shop.app","url":"https://shop.app/products/8184327340077/lympha"},{"title":"Lymphoria Reviews","url":"https://nz.trustpilot.com/review/lymphoria.co?page=5"},{"title":"~!@##$%^ vLymph Tonic Review 2026: Does Lymphatic Support Supplement Really Work? ###&^&","url":"https://sites.google.com/view/vlymphtonicreview2026doeslymph"},{"title":"Does Lymph Tonic Really Help with Swelling & Circulation?","url":"https://feedback.qbo.intuit.com/forums/920245-quickbooks-mobile-feedback-forum/suggestions/51142300-does-lymph-tonic-really-help-with-swelling-circu"},{"title":"Doctors Note Logo","url":"https://ubiehealth.com/doctors-note/native-blooms-lymphatic-drainage-drops-benefits-27102q1"},{"title":"5529011 lymphatic