/\"},{\"title\":\"i tried tiktoks viral lymphatic drainage brush for 30 days heres what happened\",\"url\":\"https://www.eviemagazine.com/post/i-tried-tiktoks-viral-lymphatic-drainage-brush-for-30-days-heres-what-happened\"},{\"title\":\"I Just Tried the Lymphatic Drainage Massage That's All Over TikTok, and I'm Floored\",\"url\":\"https://www.whowhatwear.com/uk/lymphatic-drainage-massage-review\"},{\"title\":\"I’m 42 but people think I’m 35 thanks to my daily lymphatic facial — here’s how I do it\",\"url\":\"https://nbcnews.com/select/shopping/lymphatic-drainage-for-face-rcna345135\"},{\"title\":\"lymphatic drainage gentle beauty trend transforming skincare routines\",\"url\":\"https://www.scmp.com/magazines/style/beauty/trends/article/3334716/lymphatic-drainage-gentle-beauty-trend-transforming-skincare-routines\"},{\"title\":\"Lymphatic drainage: Can facial massage really slim your face or detox your body?\",\"url\":\"https://www.herworld.com/style/lymphatic-drainage-can-facial-massage-really-slim-your-face-or-detox-your-body\"},{\"title\":\"I Tried the Lymphatic Drainage Massage That's All Over TikTok, and I'm Hooked\",\"url\":\"https://whowhatwear.com/lymphatic-drainage-massage-review\"}]\n\nI found no dermatologist commentary specifically on lymphatic drainage drops. The results cover the broader trend, though.\n\n- **Search interest:** One Russian-language article cites Rising Trends data showing searches for \"lymphatic drainage drops\" grew more than sevenfold over the past year, passing 90,000 a month by September 2026. The count grew more than seven times over the last year. That article also asks what the drops actually contain, but I found no answer.\n- **Expert skepticism of face-sculpting claims:** A SCMP piece says lymphatic drainage is billed as the holy grail of facial sculpting, with promised chiselled cheekbones and a lifted face, which is a myth.\n- **Mechanism:** A dermatologist quoted by SCMP explains the massage works by creating slight pressure gradients that help move interstitial fluid into lymph vessels. Its effect on visible puffiness is not established by these results.\n- **Sleep-related puffiness:** Dermatologist Jacqueline Watchmaker notes that asymmetric facial puffiness often comes from the way people sleep.\n- **When to see a doctor:** Zocdoc advises that if your face suddenly looks swollen, call your dermatologist or primary care doctor right away, since facial puffiness as a presenting symptom can be a marker for several medical concerns.\n- **Related TikTok trend:** Dermatologists have criticized the rubber-band de-puffing trend. One plastic surgeon said the trend is not based on science, and another source notes any effect is temporary and surface-level.\n\nOverall, the sources support skepticism about TikTok de-puffing claims. They don't evaluate the drops themselves, so a targeted search for dermatologist reviews of the product's ingredients would be needed to answer that.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3373edb3-ea35-4c09-93cb-41b8e7cea5f5","uuid":"25af1969-13ed-41f6-ac19-f95568ac997f","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:11:56.149Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"lymphatic drainage drops TikTok trend puffy face bloating dermatologist","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_015FV7XEdES5U3HGwCKRo6W5","content":[{"title":"influencers wrapping rubber bands around 203800487","url":"https://www.aol.com/influencers-wrapping-rubber-bands-around-203800487.html"},{"title":"doctors debate can my gua sha replace a trip to the derm","url":"https://www.zocdoc.com/blog/advice/doctors-debate-can-my-gua-sha-replace-a-trip-to-the-derm/"},{"title":"www.zocdoc.com","url":"https://www.zocdoc.com/blog/?p=20639"},{"title":"De-puff your face with... a rubber band?","url":"https://mdlinx.com/article/de-puff-your-face-with-a-rubber-band/7mniko3eCkSiUL5UvLYPxz"},{"title":"what lymphatic drainage really does for